# --- Logs ---
*.log
logs/
# Exception: the reproduction archive commits the training log its recorded metrics
# came from -- provenance evidence for docs/reproduction_record.md, described in
# evaluation/reproduction/*/README.md, not a runtime log. Keep the pattern narrow.
!evaluation/reproduction/*/training.log

# --- Models ---
models/


